<a class="portal-skip" href="#story">跳到产品介绍</a>
<header class="portal-header">
  <a href="/" class="portal-brand" aria-label="特友会首页">
    <span class="portal-mark" aria-hidden="true">t<span>+</span></span><strong>特友会</strong><span class="portal-beta">内测中</span>
  </a>
  <nav aria-label="门户导航">
    <a href="/sign_in">登录</a>
    <a href={if @registration_policy.allow_registration, do: "/register", else: "#join"}>注册</a>
    <a href="/dashboard" class="portal-console">控制台 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </nav>
</header>
<main
  id="story"
  class="portal-story"
  tabindex="0"
  aria-label="特友会产品介绍，可上下滚动切换章节"
>
  <section
    id="intro"
    class="portal-scene portal-intro is-visible"
    aria-labelledby="intro-title"
    data-scene="01"
  >
    <div class="portal-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="portal-scene-inner portal-hero-grid">
      <div class="portal-copy">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow"><span></span> 为每一位热爱探索的特斯拉车主</p>
        <h1 id="intro-title">每一次出发，<br />都<span class="portal-accent">值得读懂。</span></h1>
        <p class="portal-lead">车里看到此刻，特友会帮你看见更多。<br />把行程、能耗、电池与充电，连成属于你的用车故事。</p>
        <div class="portal-actions">
          <a
            class="portal-button"
            href={if @registration_policy.allow_registration, do: "/register", else: "#join"}
          >
            加入内测 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
          <a class="portal-text-link" href="#journeys">探索特友会 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-hero-notes"><span>你的车辆 · 你的数据</span><span>手机 / 电脑 / 车机</span></div>
      </div>
      <figure
        class="portal-demo portal-hero-demo"
        aria-label="特友会界面概念演示，全部为虚拟数据"
      >
        <div class="portal-demo-toolbar">
          <span class="portal-mini-brand">t+ <b>特友会</b></span><span class="portal-demo-badge">虚拟数据演示</span>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-demo-heading">
          <div>
            <small>用车概览</small>
            <h3>今天，也有新的发现。</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="portal-demo-live">示例车辆</span>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-car-stage" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="portal-car-halo"></div>
          <svg class="portal-car" viewBox="0 0 600 220" fill="none">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient
                id="car-body"
                x1="300"
                y1="30"
                x2="300"
                y2="200"
                gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
              >
                <stop stop-color="#ebeff8" /><stop offset=".48" stop-color="#7d8da6" /><stop
                  offset=".72"
                  stop-color="#323e56"
                /><stop offset="1" stop-color="#182032" />
              </linearGradient>
              <linearGradient
                id="car-glass"
                x1="220"
                y1="50"
                x2="350"
                y2="120"
                gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
              >
                <stop stop-color="#546681" /><stop offset="1" stop-color="#111c30" />
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <ellipse cx="305" cy="187" rx="249" ry="12" fill="#060c18" opacity=".45" /><path
              d="M43 145 55 116 122 103 179 61 Q213 35 282 37 L346 39 Q389 43 448 94 L519 111 Q548 118 551 141 L548 162 511 168 Q506 120 467 122 Q428 122 424 171 L172 171 Q170 124 128 124 Q87 124 84 166 L49 162Z"
              fill="url(#car-body)"
              stroke="#aab8d0"
              stroke-width="1.5"
            /><path
              d="M149 101 196 64 Q223 47 279 48 L341 50 Q376 56 425 96Z"
              fill="url(#car-glass)"
              stroke="#bdc8db"
            /><path
              d="M278 48 281 100 M348 53 365 100 M184 109 184 156 M355 104 354 158"
              stroke="#59697f"
              stroke-width="2"
            /><path
              d="M66 124 104 119 M493 116 534 130"
              stroke="#e1f6ff"
              stroke-width="5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
            /><path
              d="M195 117h23m153-3h23"
              stroke="#cbd2dc"
              stroke-width="3"
              stroke-linecap="round"
            /><circle cx="128" cy="161" r="33" fill="#101624" stroke="#66758c" stroke-width="3" /><circle
              cx="128"
              cy="161"
              r="21"
              fill="#78869c"
            /><circle cx="128" cy="161" r="12" fill="#202c40" /><circle
              cx="467"
              cy="161"
              r="33"
              fill="#101624"
              stroke="#66758c"
              stroke-width="3"
            /><circle cx="467" cy="161" r="21" fill="#78869c" /><circle
              cx="467"
              cy="161"
              r="12"
              fill="#202c40"
            />
          </svg>
          <span class="portal-car-caption">为探索而出发</span>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-demo-metrics">
          <div><small>本次行程</small><strong>32.8 <em>km</em></strong></div>
          <div><small>平均能耗</small><strong>142 <em>Wh/km</em></strong></div>
          <div><small>净耗电量</small><strong>4.66 <em>kWh</em></strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-demo-bottom">
          <span>行程轨迹</span><span>电池状态</span><span>充电记录</span><span>用车分析</span>
        </div>
        <figcaption>界面概念示意 · 所有数值均为虚拟数据</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <a class="portal-scroll-cue" href="#journeys">
      <span class="portal-scroll-line"></span>向下探索 <span>01 / 05</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section
    id="journeys"
    class="portal-scene portal-journeys"
    aria-labelledby="journeys-title"
    data-scene="02"
  >
    <div class="portal-scene-inner portal-split">
      <div class="portal-copy">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow">01 / 让旅程留下更多线索</p>
        <h2 id="journeys-title">走过的路，<br />不止一条<span class="portal-accent">轨迹。</span></h2>
        <p class="portal-lead">回看一次通勤，或一段远行。把路线、海拔与能耗放在一起，了解每段路的变化。</p>
        <div class="portal-feature-list">
          <div>
            <span>01</span>
            <p><strong>行程回放</strong>路线、时间、距离与净耗电量，一次看清。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>02</span>
            <p><strong>读懂能耗</strong>Wh/km 与 kWh 同时呈现，明确标注电池读数计算或估算来源。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>03</span>
            <p><strong>熟悉的地图</strong>支持高德地图与深浅模式，地理围栏为常去地点设置范围。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure
        class="portal-demo portal-route-demo"
        aria-label="虚构行程与海拔图示，未使用真实位置"
      >
        <div class="portal-demo-toolbar">
          <span>周末 · 山间探索</span><span class="portal-demo-badge">虚构路线</span>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-map-illustration">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 580 370"
            role="img"
            aria-label="由虚拟地点出发到达观景点的示意路线"
          >
            <defs>
              <pattern id="map-grid" width="48" height="48" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <path d="M48 0H0V48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".1" />
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <rect width="580" height="370" fill="url(#map-grid)" />
            <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".12">
              <path d="M350 0Q220 110 345 173T555 370M382 0Q260 95 374 165T580 340M414 0Q300 85 406 152T580 290M444 0Q340 78 438 138T580 240M470 0Q377 75 470 125T580 200" /><path
                d="M0 95 115 152 0 290M0 175 130 206 235 350M105 0 168 118 252 165 281 370M0 315 181 270 375 290 580 250"
                stroke-width="10"
              />
            </g>
            <path
              class="portal-route-glow"
              d="M90 282C157 282 123 201 192 201S321 240 328 171 388 81 460 84"
            /><path
              class="portal-route-line"
              d="M90 282C157 282 123 201 192 201S321 240 328 171 388 81 460 84"
            /><circle cx="90" cy="282" r="9" fill="#9ff4d5" stroke="#13272d" stroke-width="4" /><circle
              cx="460"
              cy="84"
              r="9"
              fill="#aca4ff"
              stroke="#232040"
              stroke-width="4"
            />
            <text x="64" y="318" fill="currentColor" font-size="13">出发点 · 示例</text>
            <text x="400" y="57" fill="currentColor" font-size="13">山间观景点 · 示例</text>
          </svg>
          <div class="portal-altitude"><small>海拔变化</small><strong>+386 <em>m</em></strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-elevation">
          <span>沿途海拔</span><svg viewBox="0 0 500 65" aria-hidden="true"><path
            d="M0 61 30 58 60 60 90 43 120 46 150 39 185 46 220 31 255 36 285 18 320 27 355 13 390 17 430 5 470 11 500 2"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
          /></svg><span>每一段起伏，都有迹可循</span>
        </div>
        <figcaption>虚拟数据演示 · 非真实地图、地点或车辆记录</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    id="energy"
    class="portal-scene portal-energy"
    aria-labelledby="energy-title"
    data-scene="03"
  >
    <div class="portal-scene-inner portal-split portal-split-reverse">
      <figure
        class="portal-demo portal-energy-demo"
        aria-label="电池与充电界面概念，全部为虚拟数据"
      >
        <div class="portal-demo-toolbar">
          <span>能量账本</span><span class="portal-demo-badge">虚拟数据演示</span>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-energy-display">
          <div class="portal-energy-ring">
            <span><small>本次充电增加</small><strong>28.6</strong><em>kWh</em></span>
          </div>
          <div class="portal-energy-readings">
            <p><span>充电时长</span><strong>42 分钟</strong></p>
            <p><span>本次费用</span><strong>¥ 32.90</strong></p>
            <p><span>费用来源</span><strong>手动补充</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-energy-trend">
          <span>最近 7 次充电 · 示例</span>
          <div aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        </div>
        <figcaption>界面概念示意 · 不代表真实电池状态或实际费用</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="portal-copy">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow">02 / 从一度电，到每一次补能</p>
        <h2 id="energy-title">每一度电，<br />都有<span class="portal-accent">来龙去脉。</span></h2>
        <p class="portal-lead">把零散的充电记录，变成清晰的用车账本。看电池状态，也看真正花了多少。</p>
        <div class="portal-feature-list">
          <div>
            <span>01</span>
            <p><strong>电池与温度</strong>汇集可用电池数据与温度读数，高级指标按需展开。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>02</span>
            <p><strong>充电费用可补录</strong>官方与第三方充电站的费用，都能手动补充或修改。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>03</span>
            <p><strong>数据有依据</strong>有有效电池读数时优先使用，缺失时明确标注估算，不混淆数据来源。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="portal-fine-print">可用指标受车型、固件、授权及实际采集情况影响。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    id="experience"
    class="portal-scene portal-experience"
    aria-labelledby="experience-title"
    data-scene="04"
  >
    <div class="portal-scene-inner">
      <div class="portal-copy portal-centered">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow">03 / 你的视角，你的掌控</p>
        <h2 id="experience-title">随处看得清，<br />数据<span class="portal-accent">有边界。</span></h2>
        <p class="portal-lead">电脑上深入分析，手机上随时回顾，车机上查看行车数据。<br />界面随屏幕与明暗环境而变，车辆权限始终跟随账号。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="portal-capabilities">
        <article>
          <span class="portal-capability-number">01</span><i
            class="mdi mdi-gauge"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></i>
          <h3>专注行车的视图</h3>
          <p>海拔、温度等信息集中展示，刷新间隔可调，默认每 5 秒刷新。请在安全停车时操作。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="portal-capability-number">02</span><i
            class="mdi mdi-weather-night"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></i>
          <h3>从白天到夜晚</h3>
          <p>首次打开跟随系统颜色模式，支持手动切换。电脑、手机与车机自适应布局。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="portal-capability-number">03</span><i
            class="mdi mdi-shield-account-outline"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></i>
          <h3>账号各有边界</h3>
          <p>普通用户仅能访问自己的车辆。支持两步验证、设备会话管理与远程退出。</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="portal-capability-number">04</span><i
            class="mdi mdi-cloud-key-outline"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></i>
          <h3>由你授权连接</h3>
          <p>通过 Tesla 官方授权绑定车辆，支持 Fleet Telemetry 接入。所需配置及可用数据在连接页说明。</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="portal-experience-footer">
        <span>为中文使用习惯设计</span><span>北京时间</span><span>深色 / 浅色</span><span>跨设备体验</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="join" class="portal-scene portal-join" aria-labelledby="join-title" data-scene="05">
    <div class="portal-scene-inner portal-join-grid">
      <div class="portal-copy">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow"><span></span> 特友会 · 正在内测</p>
        <h2 id="join-title">下一段故事，<br />从<span class="portal-accent">你出发。</span></h2>
        <p class="portal-lead">把那些一闪而过的数据，<br />变成更了解爱车的日常。</p>
        <div class="portal-join-status">
          <%= cond do %>
            <% not @registration_policy.allow_registration -> %>
              <p>当前暂未开放新账号注册，请联系管理员了解内测安排。已有账号可直接登录。</p>
            <% @registration_policy.require_invitation -> %>
              <p>当前为邀请内测。请先向管理员获取邀请码，再创建你的账号。</p>
            <% true -> %>
              <p>当前已开放注册。创建账号后，在控制台连接自己的 Tesla 车辆。</p>
          <% end %>
        </div>
        <div class="portal-actions">
          <a :if={@registration_policy.allow_registration} class="portal-button" href="/register">
            注册特友会 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
          <a
            class={
              if @registration_policy.allow_registration,
                do: "portal-text-link",
                else: "portal-button"
            }
            href="/sign_in"
          >登录已有账号 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="portal-faq">
        <p class="portal-eyebrow">开始之前，你可能想知道</p>
        <details open>
          <summary>加入后，如何看到自己的车辆？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <p>注册后进入控制台，在「Tesla 连接」完成授权。账号不会自动获得其他用户的车辆数据；已有采集车辆也可由管理员提供车辆认领码。</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>邀请码和车辆认领码一样吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <p>不一样。邀请码仅用于创建账号，一次有效；车辆认领码用于绑定已有车辆，两者不能互换。</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>所有电池指标都能看到吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <p>具体取决于车型、车辆固件、接口授权和采集情况。系统会区分实际读数、计算值与估算，不会把未上报的数据当作实测数据。</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>这里展示的是真实车主数据吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <p>不是。此首页的车辆、路线、数值与图表均为独立制作的虚拟演示，不读取或展示数据库中的车辆记录。</p>
        </details>
      </div>
      <footer class="portal-footer">
        <a href="#intro" class="portal-brand">
          <span class="portal-mark" aria-hidden="true">t<span>+</span></span><strong>特友会</strong>
        </a>
        <p>独立车辆数据项目，非 Tesla 官方产品。<br />基于 TeslaMate 开源项目构建。</p>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="portal-theme"
          data-theme-toggle
          aria-label="切换深浅模式"
          aria-pressed="false"
        >
          切换明暗
        </button>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/kafuunochino/teslamate"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          开源项目 ↗
        </a>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<nav class="portal-chapters" aria-label="产品介绍章节">
  <a href="#intro" aria-label="概览" aria-current="location"><span>概览</span></a><a
    href="#journeys"
    aria-label="行程"
  ><span>行程</span></a><a href="#energy" aria-label="能量"><span>能量</span></a><a
    href="#experience"
    aria-label="体验"
  ><span>体验</span></a><a href="#join" aria-label="加入"><span>加入</span></a>
</nav>
<div class="portal-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
